  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Health Areas v9.0",
    "description": "The GRID3 COD - Health Areas v9.0 dataset consists of spatial point data with attribute information. The current version supersedes the GRID3 COD - Health Areas v8.0. The following changes were made: The data for Haut-Lomami, Haut-Katanga, Ituri, Kwango, Lomami, Maniema and Tanganyika provinces were updated. Health area names were updated.",
